$string['exportintro'] = 'The archive is a frozen version of the dossier, meant for the panel: every declaration with its attestations, the certification records they refer to, and the SHA-256 digest of every file. It reads without this platform and stays available here as long as your account exists, to you only; a new export replaces it. The administrator of another platform can take it in, provided that other platform has not already numbered differently the competencies it names, and that your account has no identifier there yet (it gets one with its first declaration, export, copy or backup); otherwise the import is refused as a whole, with a message that says why, and your declarations and your managers\' signatures have to be made again on the new platform (the archive and its PDF remain a document of your dossier). This archive does not contain the deposits of your feasibility dossier, your managers\' opinions, nor the questions for clarification and your answers: they stay on this platform. You can find them in the export of your personal data from Moodle (Data requests in your profile, or else ask the site administrator), which can be read but not reimported.';
$string['exportintroother'] = 'The archive is a frozen version of the dossier, meant for the panel: every declaration with its attestations, the certification records they refer to, and the SHA-256 digest of every file. It reads without this platform and stays available here for 24 hours, to you only. The administrator of another platform can take it in, provided that other platform has not already numbered differently the competencies it names, and that the account of the candidate has no identifier there yet (it gets one with its first declaration, export, copy or backup); otherwise the import is refused as a whole, with a message that says why, and the declarations of the candidate and the signatures of their managers have to be made again on the new platform (the archive and its PDF remain a document of their dossier). This archive does not contain the deposits of the feasibility dossier, the opinions of the managers, nor the questions for clarification and their answers: they stay on this platform. The candidate can find them in the export of their personal data from Moodle (Data requests in their profile, or else ask the site administrator), which can be read but not reimported.';
