$string['importfile'] = 'CSV file';
$string['importfile_help'] = 'One line per competency, with a header row. Two columns are required: <strong>rang</strong> (the rank within the record, up to 8 characters, letters and digits) and <strong>intitule</strong> (the label exactly as published). A third column, <strong>description</strong>, is optional. A fourth, <strong>bloc</strong>, is optional too: the rank of the bloc a line sits under, empty for a bloc itself. Without it the record stays flat; with it, the blocs and their competencies are kept as a tree (two levels at most).';
