$string['orgactorsintro'] = 'The grid says what the scheme provides, after the guide (section 2.4): the rights each actor should hold and the roles of the site that give them. It reads the roles as the site defines them, at the level of the site: not who holds a role, not the overrides made lower down, not the rights of the core asked on top (attaching a record to a course also needs the core right on the competencies of the course). It does not say which actor a role is meant for: a right given to the role of another actor shows in the role names. The role of the manager must never be assigned at the level of the site. Site administrators pass every check, except to follow a vaeiste, to write an opinion and to evaluate a competency.';
