$string['privacy:metadata:certif'] = 'The certification of one bloc of a record by the direction (T-90, lot 3): the positioning of the structure, never the validation, which only the jury gives outside this platform. A status (certified or withdrawn), the date of the decision, a written reason and, when a competency of the bloc was not sufficient, the reason of the alert. Added to and never changed: the latest line stands. The reasons are free text of a third party about the candidate; they are exported to the candidate, whom they are about. Erasing the author keeps the line and removes who wrote it; erasing the candidate removes everything.';
$string['privacy:metadata:certif:alertreason'] = 'Why the bloc was certified although a competency of it was not sufficient. Free text.';
