$string['privacy:metadata:eval'] = 'The evaluation of one competency of a record by the manager who follows the candidate (T-90, lot 3): a status among to build, in the course of proof, sufficient for certification or withdrawn, and a written reason. A positioning of the structure, not a validation. Added to and never changed: the latest line stands. The reason is free text of a third party about the candidate and may describe the person receiving care; it is exported to the candidate, whom it is about. Erasing the author keeps the line and removes who wrote it; erasing the candidate removes everything.';
